   1, 'original', '{cet4,education}'),
  ('55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555', 'The Importance of Failure', 'Many people fear failure and try to avoid it at all costs. However, failure is often a necessary part of growth. When we make mistakes, we learn what does not work and can adjust our approach. Successful people usually experience failure many times before reaching their goals. What matters is not how many times we fall, but whether we are willing to get up and try again. A healthy attitude toward failure can turn disappointment into a valuable lesson.',
   2, 'original', '{cet4,psychology}'),
  ('66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666', 'Cities and Green Spaces', 'As cities grow larger, green spaces such as parks and gardens become increasingly important. Trees and plants help clean the air and reduce city temperatures. Green spaces also give people a place to relax, exercise, and meet others. However, land in cities is often limited and expensive, so planners must find creative ways to include nature. Some cities have turned old railways and empty rooftops into gardens. These efforts show that green spaces can be added even in crowded places.',
   2, 'original', '{cet6,environment}');

